{"n": 140, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "140.webp", "text": "C?\n\noO\nz\n\nS193\n\nOIL PUMP DRIVE SHAFT\n\nRemove oi! pump 11 41 000\nRemove injection pump see Gr. 13.\nUnscrew console,\n\nTake off cover (1)\n\nRemove gear (2).\n\nInstallation:\n\nOpen end of gear shaft feces down\nChecking bearing in cover (1) and seal (3),\nreplacing if necessary.\n\nDrive out needle bearing from bottom to top\nwith Special Tool 11 1 310.\n\ninstallation.\n\nLubricate needle bearing with grease.\nDrive in needle bearing against stop with\nSpecial Tool 11 1 300\n\n1112000 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nCYLINDER HEAD COVER\n\nDetach hoses (1 ... 2}.\n\nLoosen screws of cover.\n\nfastallation\n\nFirst tighten screws of cylinder head cover and\nthen protective cover.\n\nDetach oi! trap (7)\n\nUnscrew dowel sleeves and take off cylinder head\ncover.\n\nJastallation\n\nScrew in dowel sleeves with seals\n\nCheck seal on oil trap, replacing if necessary\n\ninstallation\n\nCheck cylinder head cover gasket (8) and rubber\nring (9), replacing if necessary\n\nPlace rubber ring (9) in cover and lubricate with\nol\n\nTightening torque*\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["C?", 0.112, 0.5809, 0.1312, 0.5942], ["oO", 0.2112, 0.6008, 0.2188, 0.6127], ["z", 0.2118, 0.6174, 0.2183, 0.6273], ["S193", 0.1631, 0.5995, 0.2092, 0.6127], ["OIL", 0.3232, 0.0796, 0.3419, 0.0902], ["PUMP", 0.3455, 0.0796, 0.3749, 0.0902], ["DRIVE", 0.3784, 0.0796, 0.4124, 0.0902], ["SHAFT", 0.4164, 0.0802, 0.4519, 0.0902], ["Remove", 0.2624, 0.1114, 0.3009, 0.122], ["oi!", 0.304, 0.1121, 0.3156, 0.122], ["pump", 0.3197, 0.1147, 0.3465, 0.1247], ["11", 0.3506, 0.1121, 0.3602, 0.122], ["41", 0.3647, 0.1121, 0.3754, 0.122], ["000", 0.3799, 0.1114, 0.3977, 0.1227], ["Remove", 0.2624, 0.1273, 0.3009, 0.1379], ["injection", 0.3045, 0.1273, 0.345, 0.1406], ["pump", 0.3485, 0.13, 0.3759, 0.1406], ["see", 0.3794, 0.13, 0.3931, 0.1379], ["Gr.", 0.3961, 0.1273, 0.4103, 0.1379], ["13.", 0.4159, 0.1273, 0.4286, 0.1379], ["Unscrew", 0.2624, 0.